NOTICE ON VOICE RIGHTS
----------------------
The audio in this dataset is SYNTHETIC speech generated by IndexTTS2.
The acoustic characteristics are derived from publicly available
training corpora used by IndexTTS2. The original speakers are
pseudonymized in the released dataset as SPK-A01..SPK-A32. The
mapping between pseudo-IDs and original-speaker references is
intentionally withheld to mitigate re-identification risk.

You MAY use this audio for fine-tuning, evaluation, and research on
spoken-dialogue systems.

You MAY NOT use the released audio to re-construct or re-clone the
voice of any real, identifiable person.

See ETHICS.md for the full ethical-use rider and takedown policy.

